OL,3,GNEWSABereaved mum raises over #13k with
OL,4,AKilimanjaro climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bereaved mum has climbed Mount
OL,7,FKilimanjaro to raise over #13,000 for
OL,8,Fthe charity which helped her after the
OL,9,Fdeath of her two-year-old son.
OL,11,FHarley Cunningham, from Woking, turned
OL,12,Fto Cruse Bereavement Support after her
OL,13,Fson James died from bronchial pneumonia
OL,14,Fin 2021.
OL,16,FThe 42-year-old said she needed to take
OL,17,Fpart in the challenge in Tanzania after
OL,18,F"such a hard" few years.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
